Not covered by the MIT License
------------------------------

kit/ash/wakeword/model_out/hey_ash.onnx
  A wake-word model carried over from Ash, trained with openWakeWord
  (https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord) on its published training features,
  which include the ACAV100M set. openWakeWord releases the models it trains that
  way under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, and this file is offered on the same terms. Orbz does
  not load it: an orb hears its name through Whisper (kit/orbs_kit/voicebox.py).

